Maintainer: Khronos31 <39792509+Khronos31@users.noreply.github.com>
Homepage: https://www.python.org/
Tag: purpose::console
Description: Python 3.14 interpreter
 Built on-device for rootless jailbreaks. Configured as darwin rather than
 through the iOS support added in PEP 730, so that subprocess and the rest of
 the POSIX surface stay available, which is the point on a jailbroken device.
 os.system and subprocess with shell=True use the shell under the jailbreak
 prefix.
 .
 Installs as python3.14 and pip3.14 only. The unversioned python3 belongs to
 the bootstrap's own python3 package, which other packages depend on, so it is
 left alone.
